m":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-04T19:52:39-07:00","id":1401041,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s not mechanically represented with thaumaturgy, but the Syndics <i>have</i> been able to chip away at Maramas\u2019 Fell via systematic life-affirming rituals near the borders of the shadowland.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-05T03:23:09-07:00","id":1401082,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1401033-are-there-thaumaturgy-rituals-to-reduce-eliminate-shadowlands-1st-2nd-2-5-ed?p=1401039#post1401039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Neph was pretty opposed to anything less than Cleansing Solar Flames doing it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can appreciate why. You want the returning golden heroes to actually have value &amp; something to offer.<br /> <br /> My take on it, &amp; please correct me if I'm wrong, is that it is much easier to create Shadowlands (when you have 100 Abyssals &amp; ghost hordes) than to cleanse them.<br /> <br /> If that assumption is correct, I was thinking if Mortal forces could help chip at the lesser Shadowlands while the Solars work over &amp; break up the massive ones, it would be a much more approachable task.<br /> <br /> &amp; It's cool to offer something empowering to the Mortals.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1401033-are-there-thaumaturgy-rituals-to-reduce-eliminate-shadowlands-1st-2nd-2-5-ed?p=1401039#post1401039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think there's something in the 2e core about destroying shadowlands by salting them- that this would be #1 hellishly expensive and #2 literally salting the Earth.</div> </div> </div> </div>Remove a Shadowland... with a blighted area. Lol! I like that type of hard call. It's a nuclear option.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1401033-are-there-thaumaturgy-rituals-to-reduce-eliminate-shadowlands-1st-2nd-2-5-ed?p=1401041#post1401041\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It\u2019s not mechanically represented with thaumaturgy, but the Syndics <i>have</i> been able to chip away at Maramas\u2019 Fell via systematic life-affirming rituals near the borders of the shadowland.</div> </div> </div> </div>Very cool! Which books discuss that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-05T06:09:30-07:00","id":1401096,"title":"","content":"<i>Bastions of the North</i>, in 1e, and I think CoTD:North in 2e.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-05T06:29:15-07:00","id":1401101,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1401033-are-there-thaumaturgy-rituals-to-reduce-eliminate-shadowlands-1st-2nd-2-5-ed?p=1401096#post1401096\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>Bastions of the North</i>, in 1e, and I think CoTD:North in 2e.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Correct though 2e goes into a little more detail. Bastion mentions the Syndics plans and talks about how the Shogunate had plans to use public works to reduce the shadowland of Marama's Fell but did'nt have time as things occured that got in the way. 2e's North describes the Syndics lining the section of the road that crosses the Fell with shrines dedicated to life and fertility. The celebrations of life, births and weddings and such have caused a reduction in the shadowland. It's the symbolic power of life that pushes back the horror of death that causes shadowlands.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24445-arkayriel","name":"Arkayriel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"122"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-05T06:52:13-07:00","id":1401103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daredevil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1401033-are-there-thaumaturgy-rituals-to-reduce-eliminate-shadowlands-1st-2nd-2-5-ed?p=1401082#post1401082\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can appreciate why. You want the returning golden heroes to actually have value &amp; something to offer.<br /> <br /> My take on it, &amp; please correct me if I'm wrong, is that it is much easier to create Shadowlands (when you have 100 Abyssals &amp; ghost hordes) than to cleanse them.<br /> <br /> If that assumption is correct, I was thinking if Mortal forces could help chip at the lesser Shadowlands while the Solars work over &amp; break up the massive ones, it would be a much more approachable task.<br /> <br /> &amp; It's cool to offer something empowering to the Mortals.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree with you and even if I didn't it's your game. I simply offered Neph's opinion on the matter the same way I'd try and recall a statement from a developer if you were asking about Ex3.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-05T07:16:13-07:00","id":1401108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1401033-are-there-thaumaturgy-rituals-to-reduce-eliminate-shadowlands-1st-2nd-2-5-ed?p=1401103#post1401103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I agree with you and even if I didn't it's your game. I simply offered Neph's opinion on the matter the same way I'd try and recall a statement from a developer if you were asking about Ex3.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yes! I love the old Developer quotes, &amp; they are very relevant to the ways &amp; whys things are the way they are in the system for the Editions.<br /> <br /> I really appreciate what you shared &amp; it is really helping my thinking about it.<br /> <br /> I deeply miss hearing Neph's posts on the Forums.<br /> <br /> Do you have any exact quotes on it? Just curious.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid